{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117401","id":3396767716,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Kdo_k","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117401","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117401.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117401.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117401","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117401/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117401/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117401/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c05c85581eb236f224dd15a04feda2a8d80082cc","number":117401,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix tangent decoding detection when computing vertex skinning","user":{"login":"Gaktan","id":1674095,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzQwOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1674095?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan","html_url":"https://github.com/Gaktan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gaktan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #81446\r\n\r\nWhen decoding veretx tangent in the shader, there is a special case to detect which encoding system to use (Octahedral or axis-angle coordinates). See scene.glsl, line 618.\r\nIn the issue mentioned above, some octahedral encoded tangents are exactly (0, 1) which is the value used to detect the encoding. When this special value is detected, we switch to axis-angle decoding, instead of Octahedral, resulting is undefined results. This only happened for skinned objects.\r\n\r\nThe fix is the same as the c++ code (rendering_server.cpp line ~650) : detect this special case when encoding the tangent in the skeleton compute shader, and apply a different but equivalent encoding instead.\r\n\r\nI did not modify the gles3 skeleton shader.  I could be wrong, but the compatibility mode does not seem to suffer from this.\r\n\r\nFor the fix, we could also check the uint value directly for slightly fewer instructions, but I feel this would make the code harder to maintain in the future.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api